      "event": "Step 3 complete. Worker 'app' (Sonnet) wrote proposal.md, design.md, specs/process-vehicle-data/spec.md and tasks.md; openspec validate --strict reports valid. Leader independently verified the three risk points named in the dispatch: (1) the delta uses ADDED only and its header 'Every Cycle Records A Poll Run Summary' does not collide with the main spec's three existing requirements - the failure that aborted tier 1's archive cannot repeat; (2) design D4 places the record on a guarded fall-through so RecordRun fires on every exit path by construction, and its rejection of a defer closure is technically correct (defer evaluates arguments at defer-time, capturing the zero-value report); (3) design D2 uses internal/clock.Now(), never a raw time.Now(). No database object is added or changed, so no design gate applies (D-LEADER-7)."
